version 4.0.0

中文：
- 新增免签名动态 Java 方法 Hook：Albatross.hookMethod(Member, MethodHookCallback) 支持 before/after 回调、跳过原方法、读写参数与返回值；提供 CallFrame、MethodCallHook、MethodHook 注解及 DynMethodStubs/DynStaticMethodStubs，无需预先生成镜像类
- 新增 qing.albatross.nativehook.CModule：进程内 tcc 动态编译 C 代码（compile/getFunction/close），支持 alb_module_init/alb_module_fini 生命周期回调、编译缓存与外部符号注入；新增 NativeFunction 按签名调用任意 native 地址
- 新增 Stalker 代码追踪 Java API：followFunction/followSymbol/followCurrentThread、CALL/RET/EXEC/BLOCK/COMPILE 事件流、StalkerIterator/StalkerTransformer/StalkerCallout、模块/地址 include/exclude、事件窗口超时/上限/停止原因（followThread 后端仍在完善）
- 新增 ocean trace 模块 qing.albatross.tracker：OceanTracker/OceanSinker/EventType，内置 KeyWordSinker/StringSinker/DefaultSinker，支持方法调用/返回、字段读写事件、白名单包与 trace 窗口，新增 OceanLogger
- Native Hook 扩展：延迟 hook（hookInstructionDelayed/hookNativeDelayed，按符号或偏移）、NativeCpuContext、Address/DlInfo/Libc/NativeInvokeContext 增强，新增 @FuncHook 注解
- 新增 @AsyncRpc：RPC 方法可异步执行，耗时/可能阻塞的接口不占用 agent 的 epoll 循环；UnixRpcServer.registerMethod 支持 async
- 新增/完善 demo 与回归用例：CModuleTest、CModuleStalkerTest、StalkerTest、DynamicHookTest、NativeHookTest、OceanTraceTest、TestRunner/TestSuiteRunner、OceanDemoActivity 等
- 修复 x86 32 位 release 构建初始化崩溃：Thread::DecodeObject 的 i386 内联汇编未声明 EBX clobber，-O2 下 ref 被分配到 EBX 后压入栈地址，ART 报 invalid jobject；三处汇编补 ebx/ecx/edx/cc
- 修复 16KB 页设备：libapi.so 按 16KB 对齐；HookRecord 补 hookWay 字段以匹配原生布局，修复 OceanTrace 在 16KB 页上的 ART JIT 崩溃
- 修复无 ActivityThread 进程的 ThreadConfig 主线程 Handler NPE（降级为立即摘除）
- 补全 demo native harness 的 NativeHook/NativeBackup/NativeInstructionHook JNI 实现；TargetHookTest 入口与内部版对齐，ExtendImplTest 在扩展实现 hook 不可用时显式 skip

English:
- Add signature-free dynamic Java method hooks: Albatross.hookMethod(Member, MethodHookCallback) with before/after callbacks, skipping the original method, and reading/writing arguments and return values; add CallFrame, MethodCallHook, the MethodHook annotation, and DynMethodStubs/DynStaticMethodStubs, without pre-generated mirror classes
- Add qing.albatross.nativehook.CModule: in-process tcc compilation of C code (compile/getFunction/close) with alb_module_init/alb_module_fini lifecycle callbacks, compile caching, and external symbol injection; add NativeFunction to call any native address with a signature
- Add the Stalker code-tracing Java API: followFunction/followSymbol/followCurrentThread, CALL/RET/EXEC/BLOCK/COMPILE event streams, StalkerIterator/StalkerTransformer/StalkerCallout, module/address include/exclude, and trace-window timeout/limit/stop reason (the followThread backend is still experimental)
- Add the ocean trace module qing.albatross.tracker: OceanTracker/OceanSinker/EventType, built-in KeyWordSinker/StringSinker/DefaultSinker, method call/return and field read/write events, package whitelist and trace windows, plus OceanLogger
- Extend Native Hook: delayed hooks (hookInstructionDelayed/hookNativeDelayed, by symbol or offset), NativeCpuContext, Address/DlInfo/Libc/NativeInvokeContext enhancements, and the @FuncHook annotation
- Add @AsyncRpc: RPC methods can run asynchronously so long-running/blocking methods do not occupy the agent's epoll loop; UnixRpcServer.registerMethod supports an async flag
- Add/expand demo and regression tests: CModuleTest, CModuleStalkerTest, StalkerTest, DynamicHookTest, NativeHookTest, OceanTraceTest, TestRunner/TestSuiteRunner, OceanDemoActivity, etc.
- Fix the x86 32-bit release build initialization crash: the i386 inline asm in Thread::DecodeObject did not declare EBX as clobbered; at -O2 ref was allocated to EBX and a stack address was pushed instead, causing ART's invalid jobject; add ebx/ecx/edx/cc clobbers to the three asm sites
- Fix 16KB-page devices: align libapi.so to 16KB; add HookRecord.hookWay to match the native layout, fixing the ART JIT crash in OceanTrace on 16KB pages
- Fix the main-thread Handler NPE in ThreadConfig for processes without ActivityThread (fall back to immediate removal)
- Complete the demo native harness JNI implementations for NativeHook/NativeBackup/NativeInstructionHook; align the TargetHookTest entry with the internal version and explicitly skip ExtendImplTest when extended-implementation hooks are unavailable

version 3.7.0

中文：
- 新增 Albatross.searchSubClass()，可按父类搜索其所有子类；SearchClassCallback 泛型化为 SearchClassCallback<T>
- 新增免装箱参数渲染：InvocationContext/MethodInvokeFrame 的 appendArguments() 与 SafeToString.appendPrimitive()/appendCharSequence()，直接从寄存器渲染参数，避免临时 Object[] 与 toString 分配
- 新增 native 方法 loadMemoryDexClassLoader()，可从内存加载 dex
- 将 native/RPC 参数类型常量统一到 qing.albatross.common.Const（按字符编码，如 'I'、'J'）
- RPC 支持在同一个实例中注册多个 API 接口
- 修复 JSON 序列化中孤立代理项（lone surrogate）导致产生非法 UTF-8 的问题
- 修复 MethodInvokeFrame.getArgReg() 的寄存器索引计算错误
- 修复构造函数 Hook 中镜像备份（mirror backup）使用错误目标方法的问题
- 修复 ReflectUtils 参数类型索引越界
- 修正解释器模式（FLAG_INTERPRETER）应同时禁用 JIT 编译

English:
- Add Albatross.searchSubClass() to search all subclasses of a given superclass; make SearchClassCallback generic (SearchClassCallback<T>)
- Add boxing-free argument rendering: InvocationContext/MethodInvokeFrame.appendArguments() and SafeToString.appendPrimitive()/appendCharSequence(), rendering arguments directly from registers to avoid temporary Object[] and toString() allocations
- Add native method loadMemoryDexClassLoader() to load dex from memory
- Unify native/RPC argument-type constants into qing.albatross.common.Const (char-encoded, e.g. 'I', 'J')
- Support registering multiple API interfaces on a single RPC instance
- Fix invalid UTF-8 produced by lone surrogates during JSON serialization
- Fix incorrect register index computation in MethodInvokeFrame.getArgReg()
- Fix constructor hooks using the wrong target method for mirror backups
- Fix out-of-bounds parameter type index in ReflectUtils
- Fix interpreter mode (FLAG_INTERPRETER) to also disable JIT compilation

version 3.6.0

中文：
- 新增 native 库 hook 支持：新增 qing.albatross.nativehook 包，支持 hook native 函数、指令级 hook 回调、读写参数与返回值、内存分配与读取
- 新增注解 @TargetLibrary、@Symbol、@FuncBackup、@Word64，用于声明 native hook 目标
- 新增 FLAG_INTERPRETER 初始化标志，可禁用编译强制走解释器执行
- SafeToString 支持将 byte[] 参数以 UTF-8 字符串显示，并支持配置输出总长度上限
- 新增 native 方法 decompileAll()，可反编译所有方法
- AppMetaInfo 新增 signature 字段，可获取应用签名信息
- 静态字段也支持通过 @TargetClass 注解解析目标类
- 优化 RPC 方法名 camelCase 转 snake_case 的规则，连续大写时不再错误插入下划线
- 指令 hook 支持惰性初始化，hook 时自动完成初始化
- 安全优化：MethodStubs 的 stub 方法由 public 改为 protected

English:
- Add native library hook support: new package qing.albatross.nativehook for hooking native functions, instruction-level callbacks, reading/writing arguments and return values, memory allocation and reads
- Add annotations @TargetLibrary, @Symbol, @FuncBackup, @Word64 for declaring native hook targets
- Add the FLAG_INTERPRETER init flag to disable compilation and force interpreter execution
- SafeToString can display byte[] arguments as UTF-8 strings, and the total output length limit is now configurable
- Add native method decompileAll() to decompile all methods
- AppMetaInfo adds a signature field to obtain the app signature
- Static fields can now resolve the target class via the @TargetClass annotation
- Optimize the camelCase-to-snake_case rule for RPC method names; no spurious underscore is inserted between consecutive capitals
- Instruction hook initializes lazily, automatically during hooking
- Security: MethodStubs stub methods changed from public to protected

version 3.5.0
- Support hook method return.
- Optimize the compatibility for Android 12

version 3.4.0
- Optimize the hooks for possible inline methods
- Rpc parameters support byte arrays

version 3.3.0
- For reflection annotations, it is supported to specify the class and class name
- Support hook and backup limited effective app versions
- Add the option targetClassExec to set whether the target class compiles other methods
- Refactor the code related to the hook instruction

version 3.2.0
 - Rename the annotations related to the execution mode
 - add triggerFieldName for more precise control over hook
 - Optimize object-to-string conversion, add length limits
 - The instance method 'this' may be empty. Optimize the acquisition of parameters and add exceptions to check if the' this' parameter exists
 - arm and arm64 native hook optimization. The very short jit code of arm32 hook will not cause errors. arm64 supports shorter hook instructions and cannot locate the jumped so

version 3.1.0
 - Expand the search scope to support finding methods and field references from BootClass
 - Optimize the speed of search
 - Adding an interface implementation for traversing classes is very practical for traversing classes from bootclassLoader
 - The callback index for field and method search is changed to dexpc, which can be used for hook instructions

version 3.0.0
 - dump smail instruction will print out the relevant register contents
 - Support specifying classes to search for objects from the heap
 - Implement obtain all callers of the target method
 - Optimize for extremely short function hooks

version 2.2.0
 - Unhook support.

version 2.1.0
 - Support inheriting from the parent class or interface of the hooked class
 - Anti detection enhanced

version 2.0.2
 - Optimize rpc calls and support methods for binding other objects.
 - Add some very practical methods.

version 2.0.1
 - Rpc server Optimization.

version 2.0.0
 - Supports method hook call chains, allowing one method to be hooked by multiple methods.
 - When initializing  through loadLibrary, it supports passing initialization flags.

version 1.1.3
 - Fix the crash issue on some android12 devices.
 - Add instance method argument count check.

version 1.1.2
- Fix the issue of GC triggering deadlocks during JIT compilation.

version 1.1.1
 - Optimize the hook logic and remove the abnormal features of rwx from the so library being hooked.
 - The rpc client adds support for java.
 - Add decompilation of the smali code.


version 1.1.0
 - Optimize jit compilation to avoid inconsistencies, code recycling and other issues caused by concurrency.

version 1.0.9
 - Optimize the code logic of the hook instruction to achieve better compatibility. Compatible with lineageOs.
 - jit compilation adds locks to prevent concurrency from causing jit code to be overwritten.

version 1.0.8
 - Fixed the issue left over from v1.0.5 where code execution listening was triggered only when the method was running.

version 1.0.7
 - Support direct loading of the so library for initialization.
 - Methods can be obtained through annotation aliases, ensuring that they can still be obtained even in the event of confusion.
 - Add proguard obfuscation rules.

version 1.0.6
 - Optimized the matching of primitive types.
 - Fix the issue where the system class instruction hook does not take effect.

version 1.0.5
 - Improve the execution speed of the instruction hook by only listening when the target method is executing.
 - Hooker is not necessarily an image class, it can be the target class itself.
 - Primitive types can also be fuzzy matched.
 - Can search for a method by its name. Support commenting aliases for methods, so that even after confusion, the target method can still be found.
 - Support multiple backups of a method and define the call way for the backup method.

version 1.0.4
 - Throw an exception when the target class is an interface.
 - Improve the methods related to the instruction hook.
 - Transaction optimization and entrypoint judgment of arm methods.

version 1.0.3
 - Supports hooking of instructions.

version 1.0.2
 - Support backing up the fields of the parent class and setting possible aliases for the fields.
 - The specific type of a field can be determined by passing objects.
 - Support setting the effective Android system scope.
 - Prioritize using AOT code.

version 1.0.1
 - Prohibit any instance methods, even if there are unrecognized annotations.
 - Multiple identical backup methods are not allowed.
 - In addition to disable the logging function, it now supports replacing the logging function.
version 1.0.0:
 - Initial version.